# deku fact worker

For short grounded facts (repo constants, git/diff, web facts, URL summary, or
up to three joined factual clauses), use the **deku-ask** skill:
`mise exec -- uv run deku ask --json --audience agent --root . "…"`.

Do not use deku for coding, editing, commits, or open-ended reasoning.
